{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≤ 1024
>>
Rule 11 (if the input tensor has at least 2 dimensions, its second dimension size must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then shape(v_1, 1) > 0
